<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title><%= title %></title>
        <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />
        <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap">
    </head>
    <body class="page">
        <%- include('components/navbar') %>

        <main class="page-container container">
            <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">About</h1>

            <!-- stacked on small screens -->
             <!-- left column -->
            <div class="row g-4 mt-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="box border p-4 text-center">
                        <img src="/images/pfp.png" alt="Profile picture" class="profile-pic rounded-circle mb-3">
                        <h2 class="mono h5 fw-medium text-uppercase">Devin Boodoo</h2>
                        <p class="mb-0">Networking & IT Security student</p>
                        <span class="mono mono-sm">TORONTO, CANADA</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- right column -->
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <section class="box border p-4 mb-4">
                        <h2 class="mono h5 fw-medium text-uppercase">Who I Am</h2>
                        <p>Hello! My name is Devin Boodoo, and I am a Networking & IT Security student based in Toronto, Canada. I have a strong passion for technology and enjoy working close to the system. I spend a lot of time building and experimenting with software, networks, and security. When I'm not in class, I'm usually building something, breaking it, or trying to understand why computers behave the way they do.</p>
                        <p class="mb-0">In my free time, I enjoy playing CTFs, playing video games, DJing, and building my homelab.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="box border p-4">
                        <h2 class="mono h5 fw-medium text-uppercase">My Homelab</h2>
                        <p>My homelab is a collection of servers and networking equipment that I use to experiment with different technologies and configurations. It's a place where I can test new ideas and learn from my mistakes without affecting anything too serious.</p>
                        <p class="mb-0">Currently I'm running a variety of services including a web server, a NAS, a self-hosted GitLab instance, an email server, an AI agent VM, as well as a few other Linux and Windows VMs.</p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
        <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
